[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3538468615","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112843#issuecomment-3538468615","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112843","id":3538468615,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7S6L8H","user":{"login":"yuchenyang1994","id":15642852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjQyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15642852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuchenyang1994","html_url":"https://github.com/yuchenyang1994","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuchenyang1994/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuchenyang1994/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuchenyang1994/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuchenyang1994/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuchenyang1994/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuchenyang1994/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuchenyang1994/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuchenyang1994/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yuchenyang1994/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-16T09:46:43Z","updated_at":"2025-11-16T09:46:43Z","body":"The same problem seems to be caused by Godot's multi-window feature; I experience much less of this issue when using Single Window Mode.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3538468615/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3538879321","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112843#issuecomment-3538879321","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112843","id":3538879321,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7S7wNZ","user":{"login":"pkartsev","id":46298201,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2Mjk4MjAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46298201?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkartsev","html_url":"https://github.com/pkartsev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkartsev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkartsev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkartsev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkartsev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkartsev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkartsev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkartsev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkartsev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pkartsev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-16T15:35:30Z","updated_at":"2025-11-16T15:35:30Z","body":"Confirming this behavior.\n\nProbably similar to \nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112849\n\n4.4.1-stable is OK.\n\n4.5.1-stable, 4.6-dev3 and 4.6-dev4 are all having this problem fo me.\n\nLinux, amd64, Nvidia GTX 1080 Ti,\nKDE Plasma 6.4.5,\nboth in Wayland and X11.\n\n----------------------\n\n1) Forward+\n\nShows the popup window with wrong scaling (I have 2x scaling in KDE Plasma @ Wayland) \n\nthen focus is in wrong position: mouse position scaled 2x.\n\nSwitching popup to full-screen corrects the scaling but make the window crazy wide.\n\n<img width=\"1037\" height=\"885\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f3be4fde-2cd0-4a8d-abc5-45dcda7da13f\" />\n\nThe popup menu kinda works, you can select item by mouse in blind or exit with pressing Esc.\n\nConsole shows:\n  ERROR: servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:4726 - Condition \"!draw_list.active\" is true.\n  ERROR: Immediate draw list is already inactive.\n  ERROR: servers/rendering/renderer_rd/renderer_compositor_rd.cpp:51 - Condition \"rd_texture.is_null()\" is true. Continuing.\n\ndmesg shows\n\n[104115.156783] [drm:nv_drm_gem_alloc_nvkms_memory_ioctl [nvidia_drm]] *ERROR* [nvidia-drm] [GPU ID 0x00000c00] Failed to allocate NVKMS memory for GEM object\n\n2) Compatibility:\n\nOpen project, right-click Node to add child Node, or \"Change type...\" - the editor does not show popup window but freezes.\n\nConsole shows WARNING \"/drivers/gles3/storage/texture_storage.cpp:2402 Could not create render target, status: GL_FRAMEBUFFER_INCOMPLETE_ATTACHMENT\" before freezing.\n\nDeleting .gotod/shader_cache does not help.\n\nno interesting messages in dmesg.\n\n\n---------------------\nUPDATE:\n\nJust now I managed to recover by:\n1) switching back from Compatibility to Forward+,\n2) then opening popup window into fullscreen (opens with crazy wide dimensions outside screen range)\n3) then switching it back and manually shrinking from the left upper corner using mouse.\n\nNow everything works all right.\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3538879321/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3548217325","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112843#issuecomment-3548217325","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112843","id":3548217325,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TfX_t","user":{"login":"BrokAnkle","id":94972613,"node_id":"U_kgDOBakqxQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94972613?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle","html_url":"https://github.com/BrokAnkle","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BrokAnkle/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-18T15:36:08Z","updated_at":"2025-11-18T15:36:08Z","body":"Same issue for me but on 4.4.1. I think it comes from NVidia drivers. Each time I update my drivers, Godot goes insane and I have to revert to a year old driver version and become stable again.\nSo here, when a window pops up, the editor crashes (Project Settings, Quick Load...) and even when I press play to test my project.\nJust tried in recovery mode and it still happens.\nMy infos: Godot v4.4.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA RTX 2000 Ada Generation Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8180) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-13850HX (28 threads)\nPC is a Dell Precision 7680.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3548217325/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3550544543","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112843#issuecomment-3550544543","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112843","id":3550544543,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ToQKf","user